{"id":"o-nafbmuseum-org","claimKey":"97cd7b6e64b37643483725ea479a722692a91276775b3f9ef94db9eb2161ca09","title":"Norton Air Force Base Museum","cat":"play","art":"museum","area":"San Bernardino, CA","metroId":"los-angeles","src":"nafbmuseum.org","specs":[],"options":[{"name":"New Exhibits","detail":"","price":null}],"services":[{"name":"New Exhibits","desc":"On Saturday, April 19th, at 1300 hours, the 57th Alumni Association proudly dedicated its thirteenth commemorative bench at the Norton Air Force Base Museum. This bench serves as a heartfelt tribute to the brave individuals who flew, maintained, and supported the iconic C-141 Starlifter aircraft, a cornerstone of military airlift operations for decades. The dedication ceremony took place at the museum, located in the Norton Regional Event Center (formerly the NCO Club) in San Bernardino, California. The museum itself is dedicated to preserving the rich history of Norton Air Force Base and its contributions to the U.S. Air Force. Representing the 57th Alumni Association at this special event","photo":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/13c17a_e5980b7e858d4c859174f720aca3ae47~mv2_d_3712_2496_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1600,h_1000,al_c,q_85/13c17a_e5980b7e858d4c859174f720aca3ae47~mv2_d_3712_2496_s_4_2.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":0}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"Norton Air Force Base (1942-1994) was located in San Bernardino, California.","cover":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/13c17a_e5980b7e858d4c859174f720aca3ae47~mv2_d_3712_2496_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1600,h_1000,al_c,q_85/13c17a_e5980b7e858d4c859174f720aca3ae47~mv2_d_3712_2496_s_4_2.jpg","photos":["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/13c17a_e5980b7e858d4c859174f720aca3ae47~mv2_d_3712_2496_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1600,h_1000,al_c,q_85/13c17a_e5980b7e858d4c859174f720aca3ae47~mv2_d_3712_2496_s_4_2.jpg","https://static.wixstatic.com/media/13c17